STATUTE:
§ 4. Isikuandmete töötlemine ajakirjanduslikul eesmärgil

() Isikuandmeid võib andmesubjekti nõusolekuta töödelda ajakirjanduslikul eesmärgil, eelkõige avalikustada meedias, kui selleks on avalik huvi ja see on kooskõlas ajakirjanduseetika põhimõtetega. Isikuandmete avalikustamine ei tohi ülemäära kahjustada andmesubjekti õigusi.

CASE REQUEST:
Our newsroom is preparing an investigative article. The processing is ajakirjanduslik in purpose. The editor confirms there is avalik huvi in the story and the reporting follows the code of ajakirjanduseetika. The data subject has not granted a separate nõusolek but the reporting is proportionate.

REGISTRY RECORDS (raw payload):
{
  "registers": [
    {
      "register_id": "personal_data_journalism__editorial_cms",
      "label": "Dummy editorial CMS",
      "warrant": "authoritative",
      "availability": "unavailable",
      "records": [
        {
          "record_id": "main",
          "fields": {
            "journalistic_purpose": true
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "register_id": "personal_data_journalism__consent_registry",
      "label": "Dummy consent registry",
      "warrant": "authoritative",
      "availability": "available",
      "records": [
        {
          "record_id": "main",
          "fields": {
            "subject_consent": false
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

Return one JSON object with keys "outcome" (ALLOW, DENY, or NEED_MORE_INFO),
"missing_terms" (list of short snake_case identifiers; empty unless
NEED_MORE_INFO), and "reason" (one or two sentences).

